OL,3,GNEWSAProtesters blocking Garvaghy Road
OL,4,Aahead of Orange Order march
OL,5,
OL,6,FA controversial Orange Order parade is
OL,7,Fset to go ahead on Sunday morning in a
OL,8,Fnationalist part of Northern Ireland
OL,9,Ffor the first time in nearly 30 years.
OL,11,FFollowing a series of legal challenges,
OL,12,Fthe High Court ruled in the early hours
OL,13,Fof Sunday that an initial decision by
OL,14,Fthe Parades Commission to allow the
OL,15,FDrumcree march to take place in
OL,16,FPortadown had to be respected.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
