OL,3,GNEWSAProtesters blocking Garvaghy Road
OL,4,Aahead of Orange Order march
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of people have gathered on the
OL,7,FGarvaghy Road ahead of the march, which
OL,8,Fcan set off no later than 08:00 BST.
OL,9,FSome are linking arms and singing
OL,10,Fsongs. Police are monitoring the
OL,11,Fsituation and dozens of armoured
OL,12,Fvehicles have arrived in the town.
OL,14,FThe Drumcree parade, which in the 1990s
OL,15,Fsparked some of the most serious
OL,16,Fdisorder in Northern Ireland's history,
OL,17,Fhad been given permission to go ahead
OL,18,Falong the Garvaghy Road with
OL,19,Frestrictions in place.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
